<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Shoddy Cameron | Cameron McVeigh</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      :root {
        --paper: #F1F0EB;
        --paper-raised: #FCFBF8;
        --panel: #E9E6DC;
        --ink: #1C2128;
        --graphite: #5B6169;
        --line: #D6D1C4;
        --line-strong: #B6AF9E;
        --steel: #3E5A6B;
        --redline: #A83B2E;
        --font-display: 'Space Grotesk', system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-body: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
        --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--font-body);
        position: relative;
      }

      body::before {
        content: '';
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        pointer-events: none;
        z-index: 0;
        background-image:
          repeating-linear-gradient(to right, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 0px, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 88px),
          repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 0px, rgba(28,33,40,0.035) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 88px);
      }

      main {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 28px 24px 72px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }

      a { color: inherit; }

      :focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--steel);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      /* ── Navigation ── */
      .site-nav {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 16px;
        padding-bottom: 18px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .nav-wordmark {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-spacer { flex: 1; }

      .nav-links { display: none; gap: 28px; }

      .nav-links a {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--graphite);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding-bottom: 2px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover,
      .nav-links a:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--line-strong); }

      @media (min-width: 640px) {
        .nav-links { display: flex; }
      }

      .dropdown { position: relative; }

      .dropdown-toggle {
        background: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
        padding: 9px 11px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        transition: background-color 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
      }

      .dropdown-toggle:hover { background-color: var(--panel); }

      .hamburger { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 16px; }

      .hamburger span {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: 1.5px;
        background-color: var(--graphite);
        transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
      }

      .dropdown.active .hamburger span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(5.5px) rotate(45deg); }
      .dropdown.active .hamburger span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
      .dropdown.active .hamburger span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-5.5px) rotate(-45deg); }

      .dropdown-menu {
        position: absolute;
        top: calc(100% + 8px);
        left: 0;
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(28,33,40,0.10);
        min-width: 160px;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        transform: translateY(-6px);
        transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.2s, visibility 0.2s;
        z-index: 20;
      }

      .dropdown.active .dropdown-menu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }

      .dropdown-menu a {
        display: block;
        padding: 11px 16px;
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .dropdown-menu a:hover { background-color: var(--panel); }

      /* ── Back link ── */
      .back-button {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        padding: 9px 18px;
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        color: var(--ink);
        text-decoration: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.9em;
        transition: border-color 0.2s;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .back-button:hover { border-color: var(--steel); }

      /* ── Project content ── */
      .project-content {
        background: var(--paper-raised);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 40px;
      }

      .project-content h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(1.8em, 4vw, 2.3em);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0 0 14px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      .project-meta {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.85em;
        color: var(--graphite);
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        padding-bottom: 16px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .project-meta strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }

      .project-image {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin: 24px 0;
        display: block;
        background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .image-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 14px;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }

      @media (min-width: 700px) {
        .image-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }

      .image-grid img {
        width: 100%;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: block;
      }

      h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.35em;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 34px 0 14px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        padding-bottom: 8px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      h3 {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: 1.05em;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin: 20px 0 10px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      p { line-height: 1.7; color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 16px; }

      ul { line-height: 1.8; color: var(--graphite); margin: 16px 0; padding-left: 20px; }

      li { margin-bottom: 8px; }

      /* Callout box, for a key result or design note */
      .highlight-box {
        background: var(--panel);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--redline);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 0.95em;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .highlight-box strong { color: var(--ink); }

      /* Specs grid, echoing the site's title-block panels */
      .specs-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }

      @media (min-width: 560px) {
        .specs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      }

      .spec-item {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        background: var(--paper);
      }

      .spec-item strong {
        display: block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.78em;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--graphite);
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      /* ── Footer ── */
      footer {
        margin-top: 56px;
        padding-top: 22px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      footer .footer-left { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--graphite); }
      footer .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 22px; }
      footer .footer-links a { font-size: 13px; color: var(--graphite); text-decoration: none; }
      footer .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        * { transition: none !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <nav class="site-nav">
        <div class="dropdown" id="pagesDropdown">
          <button class="dropdown-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" aria-label="Navigation menu">
            <span class="hamburger">
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="dropdown-menu" role="menu">
            <a href="/" role="menuitem">Home</a>
            <a href="/projects/" role="menuitem">Projects</a>
            <a href="/about/" role="menuitem">About</a>
            <a href="/contact/" role="menuitem">Contact</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/" class="nav-wordmark">Cameron McVeigh</a>
        <div class="nav-spacer"></div>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>
          <a href="/about/">About</a>
          <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <a href="/projects/" class="back-button">
        <span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to Projects
      </a>

      <div class="project-content">
        <h1>Shoddy Cameron — Automatic Angle of Attack Golf Club</h1>
        <p class="project-meta">
          <strong>Type:</strong> Personal project | <strong>Status:</strong> [In progress] | <strong>Year:</strong> [2026]
        </p>

        <img
          class="project-image"
          src="/images/projects/project-5/hero.jpg"
          alt="[Add a description of the main project photo]"
        />

        <h2>Project overview</h2>
        <p>
          [One or two paragraphs introducing "Shoddy Cameron" — a golf club that automatically adjusts its
          angle of attack. Explain the idea in plain terms: what problem in a golfer's swing or ball flight
          it's trying to solve, and why an adjustable clubhead is the chosen approach.]
        </p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
          <strong>Key result:</strong> [Summarise the headline outcome once you have one — e.g. the range of
          angle adjustment achieved, or a test result from the range.]
        </div>

        <h2>Design challenge</h2>
        <p>
          [Describe the constraints you're working within — swing speed and impact forces the mechanism must
          survive, weight and balance limits before the club feels different to swing, size constraints within
          a standard clubhead, and how quickly the angle needs to adjust during the swing.]
        </p>

        <div class="specs-grid">
          <div class="spec-item">
            <strong>Adjustment range</strong>
            [e.g. ±X° of loft]
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <strong>Response time</strong>
            [e.g. within the downswing]
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <strong>Added weight</strong>
            [vs a standard clubhead]
          </div>
          <div class="spec-item">
            <strong>Actuation method</strong>
            [e.g. mechanical, spring-loaded, motorised]
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Design solution</h2>
        <p>
          [Explain how the mechanism actually works — what triggers the angle change (swing speed, centrifugal
          force, an active sensor and actuator, etc.), and how that motion is translated into the clubface
          rotating or tilting.]
        </p>

        <h3>Key components</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>[Component 1]:</strong> [material, role in the mechanism]</li>
          <li><strong>[Component 2]:</strong> [material, role in the mechanism]</li>
          <li><strong>[Component 3]:</strong> [material, role in the mechanism]</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Calculations &amp; analysis</h2>
        <p>[Summarise the analysis behind the design once it exists — swing dynamics, impact loading, FEA on the pivot or hinge, or testing of the adjustment mechanism.]</p>
        <ul>
          <li>[Calculation or analysis 1]</li>
          <li>[Calculation or analysis 2]</li>
          <li>[Calculation or analysis 3]</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Manufacturing approach</h2>
        <p>
          [Describe how the clubhead and mechanism are being made — 3D printing for prototyping, machined
          components for the final version, off-the-shelf hardware you're incorporating, and so on.]
        </p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
          <strong>Manufacturing note:</strong> [Flag anything notable about how it's built — a tricky
          tolerance, a material choice that solved a specific problem, or a manufacturing constraint that
          shaped the design.]
        </div>

        <h2>Project photos / further design details</h2>

        <section class="image-grid">
          <img src="/images/projects/project-5/detail-1.jpg" alt="[Describe this image]" />
          <img src="/images/projects/project-5/detail-2.jpg" alt="[Describe this image]" />
        </section>

        <h2>Skills developed</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>[Skill 1 — e.g. mechanism design]</li>
          <li>[Skill 2 — e.g. impact/dynamics analysis]</li>
          <li>[Skill 3 — e.g. CAD and prototyping]</li>
          <li>[Skill 4]</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Reflection</h2>
        <p>
          [Once the project has progressed, reflect on what was hardest to get right, what you'd change with
          hindsight, and what you learned that you'll carry into future projects.]
        </p>
      </div>

      <footer>
        <span class="footer-left">© 2025 Cameron McVeigh</span>
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
          <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </main>

    <script>
      (function () {
        const dropdown = document.getElementById('pagesDropdown');
        const toggle = dropdown ? dropdown.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.dropdown-toggle') : null;

        if (!dropdown || !toggle) return;

        toggle.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.stopPropagation();
          const isActive = dropdown.classList.contains('active');
          dropdown.classList.toggle('active');
          toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!isActive));
        });

        document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          if (!dropdown.contains(e.target as Node)) {
            dropdown.classList.remove('active');
            toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          }
        });

        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
          if (e.key === 'Escape' && dropdown.classList.contains('active')) {
            dropdown.classList.remove('active');
            toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
            toggle.focus();
          }
        });
      })();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>